# NOTE: staticfiles/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it holds the
# collected admin/DRF CSS+JS that WhiteNoise serves in production.
# Vercel's Python runtime doesn't run a build step for us, so these
# files must be committed. Re-run `python manage.py collectstatic`
# and commit the result whenever Django/DRF/admin versions change.
